WEBVTT

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:05.890
So happy that Reencle and Whim,
uh, came together for this awesome

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.139
subscription opportunity.

00:00:07.379 --> 00:00:09.059
We call our Reencle Fred.

00:00:09.619 --> 00:00:13.179
Um, he is always hungry for
all of our delicious scraps,

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:17.479
and we love the, um, raw
material that comes from it
